<description>&lt;p&gt;Gold smuggling is now reported to fund an Islamic State-linked insurgency in eastern DRC, with gold moving through Uganda to support rebel groups. An Ebola nurse was killed by a mob and a health worker was wounded while responding to a case, prompting Uganda to tighten its border. The United States imposed sanctions on Rwanda's defence ministry and a military bank for backing M23 rebels and facilitating gold smuggling. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNMnhvbmdWV1pFaFhQNzVCM0JidlBvYTVSd2ppOENPdjVxT2tYcFA2c1ZjR2FIQ0I5VGtVUmo1SHBXWGJtRFhSXzdWd0Q0bjFLU0ZhdUxzb0pGSWRINFZYWUxmWFhERV9GMHA5SXN5WDQ5WVhPTHVVNmVfU2U3RDJJTC1WYVBFRGx3ZHVHMW41SnpsR0hkVGhUYkF0UGdfV0JsSVFBYUpsMDR5ZnNRV29Lb0h6bEthakZXSHpULURjZk1VNllvRWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOZ09fX1dBT200aVBYSWJ0ZDBndWQyWlA2RkVuclhtMEs0dlpFemtoTGpmWVFxREh2MXZWT29fSnhyUks5TXlyaXhEdW9jVjhlS2tWYkZ1Z2QyQS1aaU9FaEFLakoxQ3RCMzltb2xldkJ4UzNDRWRKM21VWXgtSXp2UlhDbkM1Vkx1emhmajZScWVHUkVmM0tMejZnTUhqV3NNY1BqS0hKem9tUDFyeU1lMGJ0VWY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFBxcXNoME5TT0NhVzNZQmZzeXZfUXhCNkVEUmNSMGZNY1pPa2drWWp1bXJ0YUwyRHFBUElRYjVPMHd5cEp5OFJ5YzBfWGhQUHY4TFR0T1E2Ty00akk?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFA0UHltUWxpb2RGV3hhRTZzdXRKLXZlcktvOE5ZeE1nX0JNaGF0Nm92bzlFamI1TlJGWXlNRjdPWkh6UXZuNTN1Z3BNeHlfYnI1SzB2OEpFMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPakJHaHd4QVJONnU2a3oyTTFJVC1fUURVQ3NLMzFrenYzVDZfTWRsMnp6WkQ4SHNDX0tkMEhyc